---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SelectedWork from '../../components/SelectedWork.astro';
const artifacts = (await getCollection('artifacts')).sort((a,b)=>b.data.id.localeCompare(a.data.id));
---
<BaseLayout title="Work — Joshua Harper"><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">Code / tools / experiments</p><h1>Work, with the receipts.</h1><p>Public source is the starting point. These projects vary in maturity; the boundaries matter as much as the capabilities.</p><p class="muted-note">Documentation reviewed 14 October 2026. This is not a claim of production deployment or independent runtime validation.</p></header><SelectedWork />
<section style="margin-top:60px"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Historical artifacts</h2><span>Original collection / 001—005</span></div><p>Earlier project notes, kept at their original URLs. Status labels and descriptions reflect the original entries, not a current maintenance commitment.</p><div class="cg-list">{artifacts.map(a=><a class="artifact-item" href={`/work/${a.data.id}/`}><span class="eyebrow">{a.data.id} / original note</span><h3 class="artifact-title">{a.data.title}</h3></a>)}</div></section></BaseLayout>
